WEBVTT

00:00:00.469 --> 00:00:05.165
Welcome to Alaventra. Rank in
search. Get recommended by AI.

00:00:06.164 --> 00:00:10.389
In tutorial 4.5, you'll
follow a run, see its credits,

00:00:10.439 --> 00:00:12.588
and open every report it delivers.

00:00:13.629 --> 00:00:18.309
First, click Runs in the sidebar. Every
analysis your team starts is here,

00:00:18.359 --> 00:00:21.734
newest first, with its
status, credits and reports.

00:00:22.748 --> 00:00:26.638
To find one quickly, filter
by website, tool or status.

00:00:26.688 --> 00:00:28.406
Here, it's Keyword verdict.

00:00:29.752 --> 00:00:34.927
Now click a run to open its page. The
steps across the top show how far it's got,

00:00:34.977 --> 00:00:36.454
from sent to completed.

00:00:37.702 --> 00:00:40.827
The timeline lists each
report as it arrives.

00:00:40.877 --> 00:00:44.688
And Details shows the credits
quoted, and what was really charged.

00:00:45.702 --> 00:00:48.727
Click a report in the
timeline to read it below.

00:00:48.777 --> 00:00:51.792
Then click Open as a page
to see it on its own.

00:00:53.748 --> 00:00:57.232
From the report, Open the run
brings you straight back to the run.

00:00:59.748 --> 00:01:03.583
Finally, Run again starts a
new run with the same settings.

00:01:03.633 --> 00:01:06.798
If a run fails, the same
button says Try again.

00:01:07.793 --> 00:01:12.493
It opens the form already filled in, so
you can check the values, then start it.

00:01:14.318 --> 00:01:19.518
So, filter your runs, open one, read the
timeline and credits, open its reports,

00:01:19.568 --> 00:01:20.565
and run it again.

00:01:21.559 --> 00:01:28.078
You can follow every run. Next, read,
download and share a report, in tutorial 4.6.
